    prov:wasGeneratedBy sub:extraction .

  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "Thus it is that no animal that has horns has also front teeth in both jaws, those in the upper jaw being deficient. For nature by subtracting from the teeth adds to the horns" ;
